s', 'Orcish Medicine', 'Palantír of Orthanc', 'Pelargir Survivor', 'Peregrin Took', 'Phial of Galadriel', "Pippin's Bravery", 'Pippin, Guard of the Citadel', 'Plains', 'Press the Enemy', 'Prince Imrahil the Fair', 'Protector of Gondor', "Quarrel's End", 'Quickbeam, Upstart Ent', 'Radagast the Brown', 'Rally at the Hornburg', "Ranger's Firebrand", 'Rangers of Ithilien', 'Relentless Rohirrim', 'Reprieve', 'Revive the Shire', 'Riders of the Mark', 'Ringsight', 'Ringwraiths', 'Rise of the Witch-king', 'Rising of the Day', 'Rivendell', 'Rohirrim Lancer', 'Rosie Cotton of South Lane', 'Rush the Room', "Sam's Desperate Rescue", 'Samwise Gamgee', 'Samwise the Stouthearted', 'Saradoc, Master of Buckland', 'Saruman of Many Colors', 'Saruman the White', "Saruman's Trickery", "Sauron's Ransom", 'Sauron, the Dark Lord', 'Sauron, the Lidless Eye', 'Sauron, the Necromancer', 'Scroll of Isildur', 'Second Breakfast', 'Shadow Summoning', 'Shadow of the Enemy', 'Shadowfax, Lord of Horses', 'Shagrat, Loot Bearer', 'Sharkey, Tyrant of the Shire', "Shelob's Ambush", 'Shelob, Child of Ungoliant', 'Shire Scarecrow', 'Shire Shirriff', 'Shire Terrace', 'Shortcut to Mushrooms', 'Shower of Arrows', 'Slip On the Ring', 'Smite the Deathless', 'Sméagol, Helpful Guide', 'Snarling Warg', 'Soldier of the Grey Host', 'Soothing of Sméagol', 'Spiteful Banditry', 'Stalwarts of Osgiliath', 'Stern Scolding', 'Stew the Coneys', 'Sting, the Glinting Dagger', 'Stone of Erech', 'Storm of Saruman', 'Strider, Ranger of the North', 'Surrounded by Orcs', 'Swamp', 'Swarming of Moria', 'Tale of Tinúviel', "The Balrog, Durin's Bane", 'The Balrog, Flame of Udûn', 'The Bath Song', 'The Battle of Bywater', 'The Black Breath', 'The Grey Havens', 'The Mouth of Sauron', 'The One Ring', 'The Ring Goes South', 'The Shire', 'The Torment of Gollum', 'The Watcher in the Water', 'There and Back Again', 'Théoden, King of Rohan', 'Tom Bombadil', 'Took Reaper', "Trailblazer's Boots", 'Treason of Isengard', 'Troll of Khazad-dûm', 'Uglúk of the White Hand', 'Uruk-hai Berserker', 'Voracious Fell Beast', 'War of the Last Alliance', 'Warbeast of Gorgoroth', 'Warg Rider', 'Westfold Rider', 'Willow-Wind', 'Witch-king of Angmar', 'Witch-king, Bringer of Ruin', "Wizard's Rockets", 'Wose Pathfinder', 'You Cannot Pass!', 'Éomer of the Riddermark', 'Éomer, Marshal of Rohan', 'Éowyn, Fearless Knight', 'Éowyn, Lady of Rohan']
